      "id": 1,
      "text": "Bolton was incorporated in October 1720, originally part of Hartford, and later split from Hartford County when Tolland County formed in 1785.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
